{"id":"cb8e0157911ac3fc","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-cantor-normal-form.md","title":"底为 ω 的 Cantor 标准形关系","display":"df-cantor-normal-form — 底为 ω 的 Cantor 标准形关系","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-cantor-normal-form","aliases":["18-df-cantor-normal-form","18-df-022"],"display":"df-cantor-normal-form — 底为 ω 的 Cantor 标准形关系","depends_on":["[[18-df-ordinal]]","[[18-df-ordinal-addition]]","[[18-df-ordinal-multiplication]]","[[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"Theorem 3.3.8; Exercise 3.3.13 (base omega specialization)","source_pages":"30–32","source_pdf_pages":"40–42","verification_status":"source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-cantor-normal-form"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-cantor-normal-form</span><span>18-df-022</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cantor-normal-form — 底为 ω 的 Cantor 标准形关系"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5ec4763cfc7da9d5\" href=\"?note=5ec4763cfc7da9d5\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-addition\">18-df-ordinal-addition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c6b98d99fde7dfdc\" href=\"?note=c6b98d99fde7dfdc\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-multiplication\">18-df-ordinal-multiplication</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" href=\"?note=5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation\">18-df-ordinal-exponentiation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Theorem 3.3.8; Exercise 3.3.13 (base omega specialization)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"30–32"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"40–42"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&lt;\\omega\">\\(n&lt;\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\beta:n\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\vec\\beta:n\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec k:n\\to\\omega\">\\(\\vec k:n\\to\\omega\\)</span>；有限序数和按索引递增、左结合，空和为 0。序数运算见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5ec4763cfc7da9d5\" href=\"?note=5ec4763cfc7da9d5\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-addition\">18-df-ordinal-addition</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c6b98d99fde7dfdc\" href=\"?note=c6b98d99fde7dfdc\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-multiplication\">18-df-ordinal-multiplication</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" href=\"?note=5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation\">18-df-ordinal-exponentiation</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CNF}_{\\omega}\">\\(\\mathrm{CNF}_{\\omega}\\)</span> 为下式引入的标准形关系，参数依次为序数、长度、指数列和系数列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CNF}_{\\omega}(\\alpha;n,\\vec\\beta,\\vec k)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n\\alpha=\\sum_{i&lt;n}\\omega^{\\beta_i}\\cdot k_i\\land\n\\forall i&lt;n\\;(0&lt;k_i&lt;\\omega)\\land\n\\forall i,j&lt;n\\;(i&lt;j\\to\\beta_i&gt;\\beta_j).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CNF}_{\\omega}(\\alpha;n,\\vec\\beta,\\vec k)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n\\alpha=\\sum_{i&lt;n}\\omega^{\\beta_i}\\cdot k_i\\land\n\\forall i&lt;n\\;(0&lt;k_i&lt;\\omega)\\land\n\\forall i,j&lt;n\\;(i&lt;j\\to\\beta_i&gt;\\beta_j).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Theorem 3.3.8 与 Exercise 3.3.13 的底 ω 特例。原书先用重复的主序数项表达；把相同指数合并即为正整数系数版。定义允许 n=0 表示 α=0，且不把一般 CNF 不必要地限制在 ε₀ 下。原有自由序列未声明长度、去 Remark 后含义不闭合的问题已补足。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-addition","status":"resolved","id":"5ec4763cfc7da9d5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal-addition]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-multiplication","status":"resolved","id":"c6b98d99fde7dfdc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal-multiplication]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation","status":"resolved","id":"5c52eb8a9d5ba532","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-addition","status":"resolved","id":"5ec4763cfc7da9d5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$n<\\omega$，$\\vec\\beta:n\\to\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\vec k:n\\to\\omega$；有限序数和按索引递增、左结合，空和为 0。序数运算见 [[18-df-ordinal-addition]]、[[18-df-ordinal-multiplication]]、[[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-multiplication","status":"resolved","id":"c6b98d99fde7dfdc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$n<\\omega$，$\\vec\\beta:n\\to\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\vec k:n\\to\\omega$；有限序数和按索引递增、左结合，空和为 0。序数运算见 [[18-df-ordinal-addition]]、[[18-df-ordinal-multiplication]]、[[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation","status":"resolved","id":"5c52eb8a9d5ba532","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$n<\\omega$，$\\vec\\beta:n\\to\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\vec k:n\\to\\omega$；有限序数和按索引递增、左结合，空和为 0。序数运算见 [[18-df-ordinal-addition]]、[[18-df-ordinal-multiplication]]、[[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"n<\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec\\beta:n\\to\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec k:n\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CNF}_{\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CNF}_{\\omega}(\\alpha;n,\\vec\\beta,\\vec k)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n\\alpha=\\sum_{i<n}\\omega^{\\beta_i}\\cdot k_i\\land\n\\forall i<n\\;(0<k_i<\\omega)\\land\n\\forall i,j<n\\;(i<j\\to\\beta_i>\\beta_j).","display":true}],"bytes":1668,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-53","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-cantor-normal-form]]"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-cantor-normal-form]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-cantor-normal-form]]"}],"outgoing":["cf95026e035bcb2b","5ec4763cfc7da9d5","c6b98d99fde7dfdc","5c52eb8a9d5ba532"]}